# Exercise: Splitting Strings
#
# `string.split` breaks a string into a list at each delimiter.
#
# Stack effect: ( str delimiter -- List )
#
# Example:
#   "a,b,c" "," string.split   # [ "a" "b" "c" ]
#   "one two three" " " string.split   # [ "one" "two" "three" ]
